+// LOCAL-PATCH 0026: claude_local runs in the shared box of patch 0017 (boxedSandboxOptions) with the environment scrub of patch 0025.
+// registerBoxedAdapter tells the spawn-time admission (0005f) that this server boxes claude_local. The box gets the agent id and
+// company id (the only agents/<id> directory it may mount is this agent's own), the Paperclip URLs the proxy trusts are the ones
+// the adapter computed itself (never a config.env value), and the child sees BASE_ENV_ALLOW plus the names of the adapter's OWN env.
+registerBoxedAdapter("claude_local");
+// The scrub reads the names when the child starts: the adapter adds workspace variables to env after the box is built, so every
+// spawn goes through this. The names are the keys of the adapter's own env (never process.env): the credentials of the agent's
+// config.env, the PAPERCLIP_ run variables (run id, agent id, API url and run token, wake and workspace variables) and CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR.
+function withClaudeEnvPassNames(localProcessSandbox, env) {
+    if (localProcessSandbox)
+        localProcessSandbox.envPassNames = Object.keys(env);
+    return localProcessSandbox;
